Per inner iteration (r): x = nums[r]; ix = idx[x].
1. cntI[ix] += 1; cntO[ix] -= 1.
2. Updates (comparisons ix vs ec, ui, vi):
   - c*: if ix < ec: L += 1; SL += x. if ix > ec: G -= 1; SG -= x.
