```python
def brute(nums, k):
    n = len(nums)
    best = -inf
    for l in range(n):
        for r in range(l, n):
            I = nums[l:r+1]
            O = nums[:l] + nums[r+1:]
            s = sum(I)
            I_s = sorted(I)
            O_s = sorted(O, reverse=True)
            gain = 0
            cur = 0
            t = min(k, len(I_s), len(O_s))
            for i in range(t):
                d = O_s[i] - I_s[i]
                if d > 0: cur += d
                else: break  # decreasing diffs → stop
                # actually track max prefix
            gain = max prefix sum of positive diffs
            best = max(best, s + gain)
    return best
```

Diffs decreasing so max prefix = sum of positive prefix ✓.

